    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative movement system\u200c</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk on any curved surfaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip on thin platforms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spit silk to swing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative art style</strong>\u200c</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use &quot;dirty&quot; ink art to show a &quot;dirty&quot; spider silk world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main character isn't human-shaped</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative world setting\u200c</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sky world built from spiderwebs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative combat\u200c</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight bosses on platforms of all shapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing and fight bosses in mid-air</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contact</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord:\u00a0jpgWEXuK</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gmail: zhiwugame</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative movement system\u200c</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk on any curved surfaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip on thin platforms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spit silk to swing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative art style</strong>\u200c</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use &quot;dirty&quot; ink art to show a &quot;dirty&quot; spider silk world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main character isn't human-shaped</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative world setting\u200c</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sky world built from spiderwebs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative combat\u200c</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight bosses on platforms of all shapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing and fight bosses in mid-air</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contact</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord:\u00a0jpgWEXuK</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gmail: zhiwugame</p>",
